            <description><![CDATA[<h2 style="font:600 15px -apple-system;margin:0 0 6px">Promptr Studio Pro 5.88</h2>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>The agent no longer trips over its own plan.</b> After compiling a brief it had to retype every decided parameter by hand, and the smallest deviation ended the run with no way back. The compiled plan now fills those parameters itself.</li>
<li><b>Fewer clicks for steps that undo themselves.</b> Moving, renaming, creating a folder, archiving, setting a favourite and binding a character run without approval. Deleting and anything that costs credits still asks.</li>
<li><b>Text files can be dropped again.</b> A markdown or text file dragged into the gallery or the agent chat did nothing at all, because the system handed it over as text instead of as a file. It arrives now.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
